<title>BRAZIL: Brazil 1996 GDP growth seen at 3.1 pct-IBGE.</title>
<headline>Brazil 1996 GDP growth seen at 3.1 pct-IBGE.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian gross domestic product (GDP) growth is seen at 3.1 percent for 1996, according to the National Statistics Institute (IBGE).</p>
<p>The IBGE said the figure reflected growth rates of three percent in agriculture, 2.6 percent in industry and 3.5 percent in services.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
